  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Fund to End Modern Slavery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Fund to End Modern Slavery is a US based non-profit corp working on combatting modern slavery globally. The mission is to sustainably end forced labour and sexual exploitation by making it economically unprofitable. Norad entered into an agreement with GFEMS in December 2018, upon request by the MFA, to support GFEMSs work program in Asia and Africa. The planned outcomes of the grant agreement is effective rule of law, slave-free supply chains and survivor freedom for victims of slavery.</narrative>
  </description>
